                                "sense_id": "43d30c43-a92c-37d7-9f70-f6d0ad5aaf0a",
                                "text": "For the AnC period, Karlgren (Études, pp. 38-39) describes the Four tones p'ing ('even perdendosi'), shang ('rising perdendosi'), ch'u ('probably falling perdendosi'), ju (ex abrupto), but then ..."
                            },
                            {
